{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在炎熱的天氣下，煮一道涼快消暑的菜式最為合適。無綫節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽分享了「青瓜涼拌肉片」的做法，這道菜式準備過程簡單，將燙熟的肉片與青瓜拌勻，是一道非常開胃的夏日冷盤佳餚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"abda3a87-f537-406d-a89c-d6f23e8a7d09.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026lefYumkTXG1784260893.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"abda3a87-f537-406d-a89c-d6f23e8a7d09.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>青瓜涼拌肉片所需材料</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豬肉片</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">青瓜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蛋白</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芡粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">花生醬</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麻醬（芝麻醬）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蜜糖</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麻油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">胡椒粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紹興酒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">檸檬（含皮及汁）</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>烹飪步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7eac3848-b07f-4d58-8355-b5a7fdcde564.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026i1EupxGZyp1784260898.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7eac3848-b07f-4d58-8355-b5a7fdcde564.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T13:18:34.459335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}